  "body": "Checkov parses HCL to find misconfigurations but does not reject a file\nTerraform itself would refuse. A duplicate resource declaration passed\niac-scan and reached main. Running validate ahead of Checkov closes that\ngap, and fmt -check keeps formatting from drifting.\n",
